; The one variable: the outline_size of a ProgressBar percentage in the bundled font, at 16 px and
; 48 px. Its ring is a stroked contour of radius outline_size / 4 px, drawn before the text
; (`progress_bar.cpp:180-181`). The bundled font keeps a fill on the atlas and strokes the ring on the canvas
; painter (ADR-0040); the atlas field holds only about 2.3 px of outline at size 48, so a ring of 4 px
; at size 16 or 48 and of 16 px at size 48 shows whether the ring is the stroke or a filled quad.

